  "title": "GHRSST Level 4 MUR Global Foundation Sea Surface Temperature Analysis (v4.1)",
  "description": "Daily global sea surface temperature (SST) dataset at 1-kilometer resolution, produced by fusing multiple satellite sensors and in situ measurements. Represents 'foundation' SST, which is free of diurnal warming effects, via advanced interpolation and blending. Redistributed from NASA/JPL source data, repackaged as Cloud-Optimized GeoTIFFs with STAC metadata.",
